WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.845 --> 00:00:05.012
- When I was 26 years old, I
began losing a lot of hair.

00:00:07.821 --> 00:00:10.189
(gentle music)

00:00:10.189 --> 00:00:11.640
It was terrifying.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.057
But I wouldn't change a thing

00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:17.790
about how everything has unfolded.

00:00:18.915 --> 00:00:21.016
My name is Anthony Carrigan.

00:00:21.016 --> 00:00:23.849
I'm an actor, and I have alopecia.

00:00:25.347 --> 00:00:29.014
Alopecia areata, is a, it's
an autoimmune disorder

00:00:30.723 --> 00:00:35.073
in which your body thinks that
something's wrong with it,

00:00:35.073 --> 00:00:37.592
and so it attacks the hair follicles,

00:00:37.592 --> 00:00:41.933
and because of that you
lose patches of hair.

00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:43.933
I was very shy as a kid.

00:00:44.823 --> 00:00:46.360
When I first started acting,

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:50.527
I began to kind of discover
this voice within myself.

00:00:51.683 --> 00:00:55.850
So when I lost a lot of my
hair, I had no idea what to do.

00:00:57.889 --> 00:01:01.773
I didn't know if I
could still be an actor.

00:01:01.773 --> 00:01:03.939
I didn't know if I could
remain in this business

00:01:03.939 --> 00:01:06.439
that was so, so image-focused.

00:01:08.513 --> 00:01:11.197
But then I found something within me

00:01:11.197 --> 00:01:13.853
that was worth fighting for.

00:01:13.853 --> 00:01:16.595
I found a whole new perspective
on the way that I looked.

00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:18.984
I found a whole new perspective on

00:01:18.984 --> 00:01:20.904
what kind of characters I could play,

00:01:20.904 --> 00:01:23.485
and I began to cultivate that.

00:01:23.485 --> 00:01:26.485
I have been typecast as the villain.

00:01:27.975 --> 00:01:29.651
I think it isn't just me.

00:01:29.651 --> 00:01:33.818
Bald guys throughout history
have played the villain.

00:01:34.835 --> 00:01:36.608
Some of the TV shows that I've been in,

00:01:36.608 --> 00:01:39.024
I was on an episode of The Blacklist,

00:01:39.024 --> 00:01:41.941
The Flash on the CW, and Gotham on FOX.

00:01:43.941 --> 00:01:46.475
For the longest time I tried

00:01:46.475 --> 00:01:49.142
to kind of create a certain self

00:01:51.093 --> 00:01:53.024
that didn't have alopecia,

00:01:53.024 --> 00:01:55.477
because a lot of the time we feel

00:01:55.477 --> 00:01:58.123
like we need to put on a face,

00:01:58.123 --> 00:02:00.206
and that's just not real.

00:02:01.515 --> 00:02:04.234
It's all about being human

00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:07.339
and it being okay to not be perfect.

00:02:07.339 --> 00:02:09.922
(upbeat music)

